# Keep the build context small. node_modules alone is ~300 MB and is rebuilt from
# the lockfile inside the image anyway, so sending it would cost more than the whole
# rest of the build.

**/node_modules
**/bin
**/obj
**/dist
**/.vite

# Built SPA output. The image builds this itself; copying a stale host build in
# would silently ship whatever was last built on someone's laptop.
src/RainBird.Server/wwwroot

# Runtime state: the SQLite database, Data Protection keys and uploaded zone photos.
# These are the one thing that must never end up baked into an image — the keys
# decrypt stored controller passwords.
src/RainBird.Server/store
src/RainBird.Server/media

.git
.gitignore
.github
docs
*.md
!README.md

.vs
.vscode
.idea
**/*.user
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Verification screenshots
/*.png
.playwright-mcp
test-results
playwright-report
